<title>CHILE: Chile/Canada conclude free-trade talks - Aninat.</title>
<headline>Chile/Canada conclude free-trade talks - Aninat.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile and Canada have concluded negotiations to sign a free trade deal, Chile's Finance Minister Eduardo Aninat said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;This agreement frees up close to 80 percent of bilateral trade,&quot; Aninat told a news conference</p>
</text>
